 and PrimaryPart correctly set; matching anchored, non-colliding home markers under NPCHomes must exist. Checkbox claims are insufficient; evidence must be current, consistent, and pass canonical tests.","unlock_next_mission":false,"next_mission_id":null,"confidence":0.7,"missing_evidence":["consistent output evidence demonstrating HumanoidRootPart presence in NPC_1","updated hierarchy and runtime evidence confirming full NPC requirements"],"reviewed_evidence":{"code":false,"hierarchy":true,"output":true,"checklist":true,"visual_runtime":true,"understanding":true},"regressions":[],"suspicious_input_detected":false,"suspicious_input_note":null,"block_type":null}',1,NULL,'v1-m02-2026-07-13','2026-07-14 09:20:53');
