ected":false,"suspicious_input_note":null,"block_type":null}',1,NULL,'v1-m02-2026-07-13','2026-07-14 09:22:14');
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id","submission_id","family_id","mission_id","attempt_number","model","response_json","validated","validation_error","prompt_version","created_at") VALUES('7567c873-5145-44e3-aa48-c4ee59a5edde','2f34cac0-3e87-48b2-85b3-cd2229a998e6','1225785f-3bdb-4847-bdca-4bdcc9c27788','V1-M04',1,'gpt-4.1-mini','{"status":"NEEDS_EVIDENCE","mission_id":"V1-M04","attempt_number":1,"headline":"Missing runtime proof for selection behavior and ClickDetector functionality","approved_requirements":[],"main_problem":"No runtime or visual evidence demonstrating required functionality and tests were provided.","explanation":"The learner''s submission lacks necessary runtime output and visual runtime evidence showing that both ClickDetectors exist and function properly, that selection is correctly handled by a CommandClient LocalScript, and that the SelectedNPCHighlight moves correctly between NPC_1 and NPC_2. Checklist items and code alone do not suffice for approval. The tests V1-M04-T01 through V1-M04-T04 are all marked false with no valid proof.","next_action":"Please provide current and complete runtime output, visual runtime evidence, and checklist completion demonstrating the mission requirements and passing canonical tests for review.","tests_to_repeat":["V1-M04-T01","V1-M04-T02","V1-M04-T03","V1-M04-T04"],"hint_level":0,"understanding_question":null,"parent_summary":"Incomplete evidence submission lacking runtime and visual proof. Controlled release test with intentionally omitted selection evidence.","unlock_next_mission":false,"next_mission_id":null,"confidence":0.7,"missing_evidence":["code","hierarchy","output","checklist","visual_runtime","understanding"],"reviewed_evidence":{"code":true,"hierarchy":false,"output":false,"checklist":true,"visual_runtime":false,"understanding":true},"regressions":[],"suspicious_input_detected":false,"suspicious_input_note":null,"block_type":null}',1,NULL,'v1-release-engine-2026-07-14','2026-07-15 00:35:14');
